/* ---------------- scene: the cosmos-kit black hole behind the whole app ----------------
   Composition follows the screen and the hole travels between them on a spring:
     «ось» (hero)   — home: the search field is the portal right above the hole;
     «витрина» (card) — an open book: card on the left, the hole beside it;
     «сбоку» (side) — data screens: the «витрина» hole on the right under a shade, UI centred over it;
     «далеко» (far) — the same on a phone: a small hole high on the right.
   Glow is always on and barely there — a deep smoke tint per section; it brightens only in response: to the score being
   set on a book (the radiation step follows the score) and to a running process. Spin: a process spins the disc up
   (energy), a finished event flicks it (spin(k)) — a flywheel, the brand reel in the rail turns with it. */
const REDUCED=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
